cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "dsh-companion-memory: Long-term memory for Chinese companion agents on DeepSeek Harness"
authors:
  - name: "dsh-companion-memory contributors"
version: 0.7.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/lvzhuojun/dsh-companion-memory"
url: "https://github.com/lvzhuojun/dsh-companion-memory"
abstract: >-
  Long-term memory for Chinese companion agents on DeepSeek Harness (DSH):
  first-person selective memory, validity + keys, per-person privacy,
  proactive follow-ups, a crisis protocol and bounded cost, on a single
  SQLite file with no vector database. Includes LifeSim, a 100-day
  simulated-life benchmark.
keywords:
  - agent-memory
  - llm-memory
  - long-term-memory
  - companion
  - deepseek
  - benchmark
